{
  "name": "AI Job Hunt Automator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎯 AI JOB HUNT AUTOMATOR\n**What it does:** Searches jobs every morning → logs them to Google Sheets → AI scores each job against your resume (0–100) → writes tailored cover letters for top matches → sends you a Telegram digest.\n\n**You'll need:**\n- RapidAPI key with JSearch API enabled (rapidapi.com → JSearch → subscribe)\n- OpenAI API key (platform.openai.com)\n- Google Sheets + Google Docs OAuth2 credentials\n- Telegram bot token + your chat ID (@BotFather → /newbot)\n\n**Status flow in Sheets:** `NEW` → `SCORED` → `COVER_LETTER_READY`",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 4940,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "57c2f795-58fa-4350-8e9f-54299026923e",
      "name": "STICKY — Title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STEP 1 — Fetch new job listings\nDaily schedule trigger → JSearch API (RapidAPI, aggregates Google Jobs) → normalize title/company/location/URL/description.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 1160,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "34b7b0fd-cde2-4125-b232-992d3de4c015",
